---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="關於 PickleStart Taiwan｜讓匹克球新手更容易開始"
  description="認識 PickleStart Taiwan：為台灣匹克球新手整理規則、裝備、預算與場地資訊，並依照你的情況提供更適合的 Starter Kit 建議。"
>
  <article class="about-v2">
    <header class="about-hero">
      <div class="about-hero-copy">
        <p class="about-kicker">ABOUT PICKLESTART</p>

        <h1>
          <span class="about-title-line about-title-main">讓第一次打匹克球</span>
          <span class="about-title-line">
            <span class="about-title-accent">少一點亂買</span><span class="about-title-main">，多一點開始</span>
          </span>
        </h1>

        <p class="about-lead">
          PickleStart Taiwan 是為台灣匹克球新手打造的入門平台。
          我們整理規則、裝備、預算與場地資訊，幫你先回答最實際的一個問題：
          <strong>現在到底需要準備什麼？</strong>
        </p>

        <div class="about-hero-actions">
          <a
            class="about-button about-button-primary"
            href="/builder?from=about"
            data-analytics-event="site_builder_clicked"
            data-analytics-detail-event="site_builder_source"
            data-analytics-placement="about_hero"
            data-analytics-page="about"
          >
            建立我的 Starter Kit →
          </a>
          <a class="about-text-link" href="/guide">
            我想先看新手指南 →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="about-hero-note" aria-label="PickleStart 的核心問題">
        <span class="about-note-label">我們從這個問題開始</span>
        <p class="about-note-question">不先問哪一支球拍最好</p>
        <p class="about-note-answer">
          現在的你<br />
          真正需要什麼？
        </p>
        <div class="about-note-mark" aria-hidden="true">●</div>
      </aside>
    </header>

    <section class="about-section about-origin">
      <div class="about-section-heading">
        <p class="about-kicker">WHY WE STARTED</p>
        <h2>新手真正缺的<br /><span class="about-heading-accent">不是更多商品</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="about-origin-content">
        <p class="about-origin-intro">
          第一次接觸匹克球時，問題通常不是完全找不到資訊，
          而是資訊太零散，讓人很難判斷哪些事情現在真的跟自己有關。
        </p>

        <div class="about-question-list" aria-label="匹克球新手常見問題">
          <div><span>01</span><p>球拍一定要第一次就買嗎？</p></div>
          <div><span>02</span><p>羽球鞋可以先拿來打匹克球嗎？</p></div>
          <div><span>03</span><p>室內球和戶外球到底差在哪裡？</p></div>
          <div><span>04</span><p>場地已經有球網，還需要自己買嗎？</p></div>
          <div><span>05</span><p>第一次開始，預算到底要抓多少？</p></div>
        </div>

        <p class="about-origin-close">
          PickleStart 想做的，就是先理解你的經驗、場地、現有裝備與預算，
          再把真正需要處理的事情整理成一條比較清楚的起步路線。
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section about-journey">
      <div class="about-section-heading about-section-heading-center">
        <p class="about-kicker">HOW PICKLESTART HELPS</p>
        <h2>從有點想試<br /><span class="about-heading-accent">到真的走上球場</span></h2>
        <p>
          不用一次搞懂所有事情，先處理現在最需要的下一步。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-journey-grid">
        <article class="about-journey-card">
          <span class="about-step-number">01</span>
          <div class="about-step-icon" aria-hidden="true">?</div>
          <h3>先搞懂</h3>
          <p>
            用新手指南快速看懂規則、Kitchen、Dink，以及第一次打球前需要知道的基本觀念。
          </p>
          <a href="/guide">看新手指南 →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="about-journey-card about-journey-card-featured">
          <span class="about-step-number">02</span>
          <div class="about-step-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
          <h3>再決定</h3>
          <p>
            根據你的經驗、場地、現有裝備與預算，整理哪些東西現在需要，哪些可以繼續沿用。
          </p>
          <a href="/builder?from=about_journey">建立 Starter Kit →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="about-journey-card">
          <span class="about-step-number">03</span>
          <div class="about-step-icon" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
          <h3>真的去打</h3>
          <p>
            找場地、準備裝備、加入球局，把「有點想試試看」變成真正的第一場匹克球。
          </p>
          <a href="/guide/taipei-pickleball-courts">找場地資訊 →</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section about-method">
      <div class="about-method-intro">
        <p class="about-kicker">HOW WE RECOMMEND</p>
        <h2>不是最好<br /><span class="about-heading-accent">而是更適合現在的你</span></h2>
        <p>
          第一次體驗、每週固定打球，或已經有羽球裝備，
          不同情況本來就不該得到同一個答案。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-principle-grid">
        <article>
          <span class="about-principle-dot"></span>
          <h3>先用你已經有的</h3>
          <p>能安全沿用的裝備，不會因為「這是匹克球」就叫你全部重買。</p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span class="about-principle-dot"></span>
          <h3>預算不是一定要花完</h3>
          <p>預算是限制，不是購物目標。沒有必要的東西，不需要為了湊滿預算而買。</p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span class="about-principle-dot"></span>
          <h3>場地會改變需求</h3>
          <p>室內、戶外、場地有沒有球網，都會改變第一次真正需要準備的東西。</p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span class="about-principle-dot"></span>
          <h3>推薦要說得出原因</h3>
          <p>我們希望你知道為什麼這個選項適合，而不是只看到商品名稱或排名。</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-section about-values">
      <div class="about-section-heading about-section-heading-center about-values-heading">
        <p class="about-kicker">WHAT WE CARE ABOUT</p>
        <h2 class="about-values-title">
          <span>我們在意的是</span>
          <span class="about-heading-accent">讓你更容易開始</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="about-values-grid">
        <article>
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>對新手真的有用</h3>
          <p>
            內容不是越多越好。我們更在意看完之後，你是不是知道下一步要做什麼。
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>少買錯，比多買一件更重要</h3>
          <p>
            PickleStart 的目的不是把購物清單變長，而是減少第一次開始時不必要的花費。
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>台灣情境優先</h3>
          <p>
            價格、場地、商品取得方式與新手指南，都盡量以台灣使用者實際會遇到的情況整理。
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    



    <section class="about-final-cta">
      <div class="about-final-copy">
        <p class="about-kicker">READY TO START?</p>
        <h2>準備好開始<br /><span class="about-heading-accent">第一場匹克球了嗎？</span></h2>
        <p>
          不用先把所有裝備買齊。回答幾個問題，
          看看你現在真正需要的是什麼。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="about-final-actions">
        <a
          class="about-button about-button-primary"
          href="/builder?from=about_final"
          data-analytics-event="site_builder_clicked"
          data-analytics-detail-event="site_builder_source"
          data-analytics-placement="about_final"
          data-analytics-page="about"
        >
          建立我的 Starter Kit →
        </a>
        <a class="about-button about-button-secondary" href="/guide">
          先看新手指南
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-v2 {
    --about-navy: #10243f;
    --about-blue: #087fa5;
    --about-lime: #e2f52c;
    --about-cream: #fbfaf4;
    --about-line: #dce6e9;
    --about-muted: #647487;
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 48px 28px 88px;
    color: var(--about-navy);
  }

  .about-v2 * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  .about-kicker {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    color: var(--about-blue);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .about-kicker-light {
    color: #9eddeb;
  }

  .about-nowrap {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .about-hero {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.52fr) minmax(300px, 0.68fr);
    gap: 52px;
    align-items: stretch;
    padding: 56px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--about-line);
    border-radius: 34px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 12%, rgba(226, 245, 44, 0.18), transparent 28%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #f7fbfb 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(16, 36, 63, 0.08);
  }

  .about-hero-copy {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .about-hero h1,
  .about-section h2,
  .about-final-cta h2 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--about-navy);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    max-width: 820px;
    font-size: clamp(2.65rem, 3.8vw, 3.5rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  .about-title-line {
    display: block;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .about-title-line + .about-title-line {
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .about-title-main {
    color: var(--about-navy);
  }

  .about-title-accent,
  .about-heading-accent {
    color: var(--about-blue);
  }

  .about-lead {
    max-width: 730px;
    margin: 30px 0 0;
    color: #4d5e72;
    font-size: 1.04rem;
    line-height: 1.95;
  }

  .about-lead strong {
    color: var(--about-navy);
  }

  .about-hero-actions,
  .about-final-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 18px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .about-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    min-height: 54px;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 0 24px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform 160ms ease, box-shadow 160ms ease;
  }

  .about-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .about-button-primary {
    color: var(--about-navy);
    background: var(--about-lime);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(193, 214, 22, 0.2);
  }

  .about-button-secondary {
    border: 1px solid rgba(16, 36, 63, 0.16);
    color: var(--about-navy);
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .about-text-link {
    color: var(--about-blue);
    font-weight: 750;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .about-hero-note {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 350px;
    padding: 34px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 28px;
    color: #ffffff;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 85%, rgba(226, 245, 44, 0.22), transparent 27%),
      var(--about-navy);
  }

  .about-note-label {
    color: #9eddeb;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .about-note-question {
    margin: 56px 0 0;
    color: #d7e4ec;
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .about-note-answer {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    max-width: 310px;
    font-size: clamp(1.85rem, 2.5vw, 2.35rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.32;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .about-note-mark {
    position: absolute;
    right: 30px;
    bottom: 18px;
    color: var(--about-lime);
    font-size: 4.2rem;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .about-section {
    padding: 88px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--about-line);
  }

  .about-section-heading {
    max-width: 520px;
  }

  .about-section-heading h2,
  .about-method-intro h2,
  .about-transparency h2,
  .about-final-cta h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.25vw, 3.25rem);
    line-height: 1.16;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .about-section-heading-center {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto 42px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .about-section-heading-center > p:last-child {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 18px auto 0;
    color: var(--about-muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-origin {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(330px, 0.86fr) minmax(0, 1.14fr);
    gap: 72px;
  }

  .about-origin-content {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .about-origin-intro,
  .about-origin-close,
  .about-method-intro > p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: #536579;
    font-size: 1.02rem;
    line-height: 1.95;
  }

  .about-question-list {
    margin: 32px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--about-line);
  }

  .about-question-list > div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 56px 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 17px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--about-line);
  }

  .about-question-list span {
    color: var(--about-blue);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }

  .about-question-list p {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .about-journey-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 18px;
  }

  .about-journey-card {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 360px;
    padding: 30px;
    border: 1px solid var(--about-line);
    border-radius: 26px;
    background: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 14px 40px rgba(16, 36, 63, 0.045);
  }

  .about-journey-card-featured {
    background:
      linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(226, 245, 44, 0.28), rgba(238, 248, 251, 0.84));
    border-color: rgba(8, 127, 165, 0.22);
  }

  .about-step-number {
    display: block;
    color: var(--about-blue);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  }

  .about-step-icon {
    display: grid;
    width: 54px;
    height: 54px;
    place-items: center;
    margin: 50px 0 22px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    color: var(--about-navy);
    background: var(--about-lime);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 900;
  }

  .about-journey-card h3,
  .about-principle-grid h3,
  .about-values-grid h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--about-navy);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .about-journey-card p,
  .about-principle-grid p,
  .about-values-grid p {
    color: var(--about-muted);
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .about-journey-card a {
    position: absolute;
    left: 30px;
    bottom: 30px;
    color: var(--about-blue);
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .about-method {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(340px, 0.92fr) minmax(0, 1.08fr);
    gap: 68px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-method-intro {
    max-width: 500px;
  }

  .about-method-intro > p:last-child {
    margin-top: 22px;
  }

  .about-principle-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 14px;
  }

  .about-principle-grid article {
    min-height: 220px;
    padding: 26px;
    border-radius: 22px;
    background: var(--about-cream);
    border: 1px solid #ece9de;
  }

  .about-principle-dot {
    display: block;
    width: 11px;
    height: 11px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--about-lime);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px rgba(226, 245, 44, 0.22);
  }

  .about-values-heading {
    max-width: 1040px;
  }

  .about-values-title span {
    display: block;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .about-values-title span + span {
    margin-top: 6px;
  }

  .about-values-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 0;
    margin-top: 42px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--about-line);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--about-line);
  }

  .about-values-grid article {
    min-height: 250px;
    padding: 34px;
  }

  .about-values-grid article + article {
    border-left: 1px solid var(--about-line);
  }

  .about-values-grid span {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 56px;
    color: var(--about-blue);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .about-transparency {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.22fr) minmax(330px, 0.78fr);
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 88px;
    padding: 52px;
    border: 0;
    border-radius: 30px;
    color: #ffffff;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 95% 10%, rgba(226, 245, 44, 0.16), transparent 30%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, #10243f, #164764);
  }

  .about-transparency h2 {
    color: #ffffff;
    max-width: 560px;
  }

  .about-transparency-copy > p:not(.about-kicker) {
    max-width: 680px;
    color: #d6e2ea;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .about-transparency-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 18px 28px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .about-transparency-links a {
    color: var(--about-lime);
    font-weight: 800;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .about-transparency-rule {
    padding: 30px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
    border-radius: 24px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  }

  .about-transparency-rule span {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    color: #9eddeb;
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
  }

  .about-transparency-rule strong {
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 2.2vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .about-final-cta {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
    gap: 44px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 34px;
    padding: 56px 10px 18px;
  }

  .about-final-copy {
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .about-final-cta p:not(.about-kicker) {
    max-width: 640px;
    color: var(--about-muted);
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  .about-final-actions {
    justify-content: flex-end;
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1000px) {
    .about-hero {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(280px, 0.75fr);
      gap: 32px;
      padding: 44px;
    }

    .about-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4.7vw, 3.35rem);
    }

    .about-origin,
    .about-method {
      gap: 46px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-v2 {
      padding: 28px 18px 64px;
    }

    .about-hero,
    .about-origin,
    .about-method,
    .about-transparency,
    .about-final-cta {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about-hero {
      padding: 38px 28px;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .about-title-line {
      display: block;
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .about-title-line + .about-title-line {
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .about-values-title span {
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .about-hero-note {
      min-height: 290px;
    }

    .about-origin,
    .about-method {
      gap: 34px;
    }

    .about-section-heading,
    .about-method-intro {
      max-width: 720px;
    }

